{"v":4,"catch":"終極防禦戰","desc":"\"FINALIZER SUPER TRANSFORMATION」是 KONAMI 於 1985 年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n目標是操作可變裝甲戰鬥系統「FINALIZER」，從失控的「Odes-30i」手中拯救人類。\n充分利用階段中出現的盾牌、各種武器和零件，邊充能邊戰鬥。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-08-29","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9fc5ebc74e6472f3dc4df0c0e8f4c37635826501a6d50b9c89998d82c4f2f9f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3bded72eacd1ad85bc2e2e75f4b0f0c1d68e55cf986efc565d1e0396b6f7effe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8344680b483cc555ca8aedf67db6ec638aef8f99abaf953cce56d35183bc9239.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f5ffee7173c5ca1ccfbd31d7b50571670ed2c291c5712c1231f530d5488d81b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/681a6022932139862b68c5b7ff7c6a42efd183a2e5ce41355801814904546c35.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f30283d447f4b0d530a2f1b501a6df228e041a44bad525a907d7069a1db3972.jpg"],"titleId":"0100af101f816000","dlc":[]}